for the cpacf km instruction.

Signed-off-by: Harald Freudenberger <freude@linux.ibm.com>
Tested-by: Holger Dengler <dengler@linux.ibm.com>
Reviewed-by: Ilya Leoshkevich <iii@linux.ibm.com>
---
